WEBVTT

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:02.616
She's also encouraging
her team members to do the same.

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:05.836
JM: I lead some of my calls
in a surprising way

00:22:05.860 --> 00:22:08.917
and have everyone talk about
what have they done for themselves

00:22:08.941 --> 00:22:10.092
in the past week.

00:22:10.116 --> 00:22:12.586
Not at work, but what have
they done for themselves.

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:15.186
So it allows us to hold
each other accountable.

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.339
AG: And when her colleagues
run into trouble,

00:22:17.363 --> 00:22:20.126
Joanne's there for them,
just like they were for her.

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.406
JM: Two weeks ago,

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:25.393
one of my direct reports
called me to share with me

00:22:25.417 --> 00:22:28.056
that she had just been diagnosed
with breast cancer.

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:31.306
And I just knew what
we needed to do to support her.